"The route as filed — a dashed line through every fix, with the one being flown to picked out. Procedures are expanded to the fixes they contain. Drawn on the flat map and the planet alike. Most pilots file nothing, and nothing is drawn when they haven't." = "按申报的航路——一条穿过每个航路点的虚线，并突出当前飞往的点。程序会展开为其包含的航路点。平面地图和星球上都会绘制。大多数飞行员不申报，那时就不绘制。";
