"Tapping a real aeroplane opens the same flight window the server's traffic does, badged so the two can never be confused. What is inside it is thinner, and honestly so: there is no pilot behind an ADS-B contact, no plan filed with our backend and no history from before you started watching, so those parts are absent rather than empty." = "轻点真实飞机会打开与服务器交通相同的航班窗口，并带有徽标，两者绝不会混淆。内容较少，这很诚实：ADS-B 目标背后没有飞行员，我们后台没有申报计划，也没有你开始观看之前的历史——所以这些部分直接不显示，而不是空着。";
"Terms of Service" = "服务条款";
"The fan in front of the aircraft, which is what you would fly with." = "飞机前方的扇形，这是实际飞行时会用的。";
"The filed route, both ends of it, and the traffic around the aircraft, heading up." = "申报航路、两端以及飞机周边的交通，航向朝上。";
"The full compass, which shows what is behind you as well." = "完整罗盘，也会显示你身后的情况。";
"The layer asks once every fifteen seconds for what is within 250 miles of the middle of your map, and holds still between times the same way the server's traffic does. Zoomed further out than about a country across it draws nothing, because one sweep at that scale is a blot rather than a picture of the world." = "该图层每十五秒请求一次地图中心 250 英里内的数据，其间保持静止，与服务器交通一样。缩小到超过一个国家宽度时不绘制任何内容，因为那种尺度的扫描只是一团污点，而不是世界的图像。";
"The organised track system, republished twice a day and coloured by letter, with the levels each track is valid at. It is what explains a hundred aircraft flying in parallel lines across the ocean." = "有组织航迹系统，每天发布两次，按字母着色，并标注各航迹有效的高度层。这就是上百架飞机在海上平行飞行的原因。";
"The whole tracker" = "完整追踪器";
"Theme" = "主题";
