"Washes the map down towards black or up towards white, underneath the traffic. The aircraft, the routes and the airport diagrams are untouched — only the map behind them moves." = "在交通下方将地图调暗至黑色或调亮至白色。飞机、航路和机场图不受影响——只有背后的地图变化。";
